# git-crypt: transparently GPG-encrypt secrets committed to this PUBLIC repo.
# Scoped deliberately to individual files — do NOT broaden to a bare `*.env`
# glob, which would sweep every other service's uncommitted secrets into the
# public history. Add new paths one line at a time.
